          <h1 class="text-[32px] max-[640px]:text-[24px] text-[#1A1A1A] font-medium leading-[1.25] mb-[32px]">Terms of service</h1>

          <h2>Overview</h2>
          <p>TheRedScroll is operated by BeyondBorderGroup LTD, registered in Hong Kong SAR. By accessing our website or using our services, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our website or services.</p>

