          <h2>Payment terms</h2>
          <p>Payment terms are monthly in advance unless otherwise specified in the client agreement. Late payments may accrue interest at 1.5% per month. We reserve the right to suspend services if payment is more than 15 days overdue.</p>

          <h2>Confidentiality</h2>
          <p>Both parties agree to maintain the confidentiality of any proprietary or sensitive information shared during the engagement. This obligation continues for two years after the end of the engagement.</p>

