          <h2>Termination</h2>
          <p>Either party may terminate a service engagement with written notice as specified in the client agreement. We reserve the right to suspend or terminate access to our website or services for violations of these terms.</p>

          <h2>Governing law</h2>
          <p>These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Hong Kong SAR. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Hong Kong SAR.</p>

